      "behavior": "HR profile writes are atomic, including staged leave/attendance/document changes. Own/manager directory projections must omit unauthorized private fields. Protect current/root profile; reject deletion with live tasks or signed contracts. Status active/inactive/resigned; resigned needs date/reason. Validate emails, dates, leave overlap, attendance duplicates/breaks; the staged HR editor calculates entitlement and requests overrides, documents, evaluations 0–100, disciplinary reasons and linked approvals. R29 adds draft, gated activation and server-protected attendance/evaluations. Contract not required for activation.",
