          "startDate": "2026-10-01",
          "endDate": "2026-10-02"
        },
        "status": "pending"
      },
      "behavior": "Types/routes are the exact HR request table below. Route and actor are server-derived. Only the current manager/department stage can approve/reject; once final, source effects apply once. Self-service cannot impersonate another employee. Final-result acknowledgement is limited to the affected employee. Type-specific dates, times, amount, destination and documents are validated.",
      "source": "04,16,30–33",
      "mode": "array",
      "delete": false
    },
